msgstr "El snap %q ya está instalado; consulte «snap help refresh»"

#. TRANSLATORS: %q is for the snap name, %s is the full requested channel
#: cmd/snap/error.go:384
#, c-format
msgid ""
"snap %q is not available on %s but is available to install on the following "
